    ["60品武器箱"] = "Level 60 Weapon Box",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【灰雾测试充值返还】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>返还概述：</>「灰雾测试」为计费删档测试。测试期间累计充值的金额（含购买金镑、愚者福音、时代恩典、命运馈赠及其他现金付费商品），将在公测后按规则返还，<Assistant_Red>1元=10金镑</>。\n<Assistant_Title2>金镑/绑定金镑返还：</>累计充值<Assistant_Red>0~4000元</>部分，返还120%金镑+50%绑定金镑；超过4000元部分，仅返还120%金镑，不额外赠送绑定金镑。举例：充值5000元，金镑返还60000（5000×10×120%），绑定金镑返还20000（4000×10×50%）。\n<Assistant_Title2>愚者福音返还：</>购买愚者福音的金额计入累计充值，公测后返还愚者福音道具，<Assistant_Red>最多返还2份</>；超过2份的金额仍计入充值总额但不额外返还道具。返还道具需主动使用，使用后获得30天权益，不会再次获得购买时赠送的金镑。\n<Assistant_Title2>时代恩典/命运馈赠返还：</>购买金额同样计入累计充值，公测后返还对应战令道具。若多角色购买多份战令，<Assistant_Red>最多返还1份</>，优先返还更高档位的命运馈赠；其余战令金额仍计入充值总额但不额外返还道具。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>公测后使用同一账号登录对应渠道，创建角色并完成第一章主线任务后，会收到返利邮件通知，前往<Assistant_Property1>廷根</>与NPC<Assistant_Property2>吉福特</>对话领取。返还的道具保存至背包，需主动使用后激活，使用前不会失效。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取期限：</>公测后<Assistant_Red>6个月</>内有效，过期后不再支持领取。同一账号下返利仅可由<Assistant_Red>一名角色领取一次</>，无法跨账号转移。官服充值仅可在官服领取，渠道服充值仅可在渠道服领取。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Gray Fog Test Recharge Refund】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Refund Overview: </>\"Gray Fog Test\" is a paid data-wiping test. The total amount recharged during the test (including purchases of Gold Pounds, Fool's Gospel, Era's Grace, Fate's Gift, and other cash-paid items) will be refunded after the official launch according to the rules, <Assistant_Red>1 Yuan = 10 Gold Pounds</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Gold Pound/Bound Gold Pound Refund: </>For the cumulative recharge portion of <Assistant_Red>0~4000 Yuan</>, 120% Gold Pounds + 50% Bound Gold Pounds will be refunded; for the portion exceeding 4000 Yuan, only 120% Gold Pounds will be refunded, with no additional Bound Gold Pounds. Example: For a 5000 Yuan recharge, 60000 Gold Pounds (5000×10×120%) and 20000 Bound Gold Pounds (4000×10×50%) will be refunded.\n<Assistant_Title2>Fool's Gospel Refund: </>The amount spent on purchasing Fool's Gospel counts towards the cumulative recharge. After the official launch, Fool's Gospel items will be refunded, <Assistant_Red>up to a maximum of 2 copies</>; amounts exceeding 2 copies still count towards the total recharge but no additional items will be refunded. Refunded items must be actively used to obtain 30 days of benefits; you will not receive the Gold Pounds gifted at the time of purchase again.\n<Assistant_Title2>Era's Grace/Fate's Gift Refund: </>Purchase amounts also count towards the cumulative recharge. After the official launch, corresponding Battle Pass items will be refunded. If multiple characters purchase multiple Battle Passes, <Assistant_Red>a maximum of 1 copy will be refunded</>, prioritizing the higher-tier Fate's Gift; the remaining Battle Pass amounts still count towards the total recharge but no additional items will be refunded.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Claim: </>After the official launch, log in with the same account on the corresponding platform, create a character, and complete the Chapter 1 main quest. You will receive a rebate notification email. Go to <Assistant_Property1>Tingen</> and talk to the NPC <Assistant_Property2>Gifford</> to claim it. Refunded items are saved to the Inventory and must be actively used to activate; they will not expire before use.\n<Assistant_Title2>Claim Deadline: </>Valid within <Assistant_Red>6 months</> after the official launch; claims will not be supported after expiration. Rebates under the same account can only be claimed by <Assistant_Red>one character once</> and cannot be transferred across accounts. Official server recharges can only be claimed on the official server, and platform server recharges can only be claimed on the platform server.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【百里挑蛋】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>时代百态</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>广场上人头攒动，似乎在举办什么热闹的活动。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>64级</>后，前往{Location:[廷根(1175,1029)]|17506;3313;-1974;2;5200002;0}可触发任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>[One in a Hundred Eggs]</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Life in the Era</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>The square is bustling with people; it seems some lively event is being held.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Once your Acting Level reaches <Assistant_Red>64</>, head to {Location:[Tingen(1175,1029)]|17506;3313;-1974;2;5200002;0} to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive Experience, Bound Sols, Invoice Receipt, Adventure Medal, World Adventure Treasure Progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【非凡扮演】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>介绍：</>蕴含着其他途径能力的<Assistant_Red>光球</>，触碰后可运用不同途径的非凡能力，寻获隐蔽宝箱。\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法指引：</>\n<Assistant_Title3>1. 寻找非凡扮演</>\n可通过以下任一方式前往玩法：\n<Assistant_Property2>跑团入口：</>打开菜单进入【跑团】，加入任意教团后，在【秩序世界】中选择【非凡扮演】，点击【前往】即可自动寻路。\n<Assistant_Property1>地图入口：</>打开地图，切换至【探秘】页签，在【世界详情】中查看【非凡扮演】玩法图标，并根据图标指引，在地图中找到对应标识，点击【前往】即可自动寻路。\n<Assistant_Title3>2. 扮演序列者</>\n与光球互动，完成检定后即可进入对应途径的非凡扮演，体验专属非凡能力。\n<Assistant_Title3>3. 获取奖励</>\n扮演完毕后，获得隐藏宝箱奖励，增加所在地图的完成度。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Extraordinary Roleplay】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Introduction: </>Spheres of light containing the abilities of other pathways. <Assistant_Red>Touch </>them to utilize the extraordinary abilities of different pathways and find hidden treasure chests.\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Guide: </>\n<Assistant_Title3>1. Finding Extraordinary Roleplay</>\nYou can navigate to this activity using either of the following methods:\n<Assistant_Property2>TTRPG Entry:</>Open the Menu, enter [TTRPG], join any organization, select [Extraordinary Roleplay] in the [Orderly World], and click [Go] to start auto-pathing.\n<Assistant_Property1>Map Entry:</>Open the map, switch to the [Exploration] tab, view the [Extraordinary Roleplay] icon in [World Details], find the corresponding marker on the map based on the icon's guidance, and click [Go] to start auto-pathing.\n<Assistant_Title3>2. Roleplaying a Sequence Beyonder</>\nInteract with the sphere of light and complete the check to enter the Extraordinary Roleplay of the corresponding pathway and experience exclusive extraordinary abilities.\n<Assistant_Title3>3. Obtaining Rewards</>\nAfter finishing the roleplay, you will receive a hidden treasure chest reward and increase the completion progress of the current map.",
    ["<HighLight>折幕</>的叠加上限提升至<HighLight>10</>层。达到<HighLight>10</>层时，返还<HighLight>3秒</><HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86051080\" color=\"#f4a067\">空间牢笼</>冷却时间和<HighLight>5秒</><HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86052010\" color=\"#f4a067\">漫游</>冷却时间。\n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86051080\" color=\"#f4a067\">空间牢笼</>协同攻击伤害提高<HighLight>100%</>。"] = "The stack limit of <HighLight>Folding Screen</> is increased to <HighLight>10</> stacks. Upon reaching <HighLight>10</> stacks, refund <HighLight>3 seconds</> of the <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86051080\" color=\"#f4a067\">Space Cage</> cooldown and <HighLight>5 seconds</> of the <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86052010\" color=\"#f4a067\">Roaming</> cooldown. The coordinated attack damage of \n<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86051080\" color=\"#f4a067\">Space Cage</> is increased by <HighLight>100%</>.",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>轻柔网纱・白羽缀饰\n羽翼于辉光舒展，金属于暗影凝结，互为倒影，各自完整。"] = "<Highlight>Craftsmanship: </>Soft Mesh & White Feather Embellishments\nWings spread in brilliance, metal condenses in shadow; they are reflections of each other, each complete in itself.",
