    ["IOS抓帧"] = "IOS Frame Capture",
    ["Welcome to Tingen, {{先生|女士}}! Would you like to take a carriage? It can reach anywhere in Tingen, and we even provide a free guided tour!"] = "Welcome to Tingen, {{Sir|Madam}}! Would you like to take a carriage? It can reach anywhere in Tingen, and we even provide a free guided tour!",
    ["“从爱上世界的那天，就开始踏上了旅途……”"] = "\"From the day it fell in love with the world, it began its journey...\"",
    ["　　这地方太邪门了。已经失踪三个人了，寻宝队的其他人居然还要继续？他们有病吧？\n　　想不通，真的想不通。为什么这么多人发现怪事还不跑？考古的、勘探的、寻宝的……他们不要命了吗？\n　　算了，罗塞尔大帝曾说过，人各有命——我先逃了。顺着这条河划出去，然后找个教堂住下，天天祷告直到这邪门的事过去。\n　　再见了！这见鬼的霍纳奇斯山！"] = "This place is too evil. Three people have already gone missing, and the rest of the treasure hunting team actually wants to continue? Are they sick? \n I can't understand it, I really can't. Why don't so many people run away after discovering strange things? Archaeologists, surveyors, treasure hunters... don't they value their lives? \n Forget it, Emperor Roselle once said, everyone has their own fate—I'm escaping first. I'll row out along this river, then find a church to stay in, praying every day until this evil matter passes. \n Goodbye! This godforsaken Hornacis Mountain!",
