    ["召唤星之虫幻化为的秘偶释放星痕技能，展开星门攻击自身前方范围内的敌人。释放时若自身未拥有<HighLight>秘法能量</>，则获得<HighLight>秘法能量</>，持续70秒。若拥有<HighLight>秘法能量</>，则会额外展开一个星门并刷新<HighLight>秘法能量</>的持续时间。"] = "Summon a marionette transformed from a Worm of Star to unleash the Star Trace skill, deploying a Star Gate to attack enemies in a range in front of it. If you do not possess <HighLight>Arcane Energy</> upon casting, you gain <HighLight>Arcane Energy</> for 70 seconds. If you already possess <HighLight>Arcane Energy</>, an additional Star Gate is deployed and the duration of <HighLight>Arcane Energy</> is refreshed.",
